# Vibecoding Discipline

- Batch related work into coherent blocks.
- Keep one active objective per block.
- Record checkpoints only after meaningful state changes.
- Prefer durable summaries over repeated context restatement.
- Delegate deep domain work to specialized skills or subagents.
- If drift from the approved roadmap is detected, stop and restate the correct course.
- Minimize recovery cost across sessions.
- Preserve the five-layer output format when producing architectural guidance.
